  "releaseNotes": "* Fixed a Forbidden error that occurred when using HtmlArea or HtmlLayout with certain URLs.\n* Fixed an IndexOutOfRangeException when merging PDFs from byte data.\n* Fixed a FormatException encountered while merging a specific PDF document.\n* Fixed a hanging issue when rendering HtmlLayout with certain HTML content.\n* Fixed an issue in ReportWriter where the Format function did not work correctly with aggregate functions and when formatting date/time values.\n* Fixed an issue with Link element placement when preceding data expanded dynamically.\n* Fixed an InvalidCastException that occurred when extracting images from a specific PDF document.\n* Added support for merging PDFs that contain extra/junk content before the %PDF header.",
  "requireLicenseAcceptance": true,
  "summary": ".NET API for PDF development.  PDF creation, merging, form filling, stamping, securing/encryption and much more.  This SDK is easy to use and contains tons of features. It also supports .NET Standard2.0",
  "title": "DynamicPDF Core Suite for .NET",
